@startuml
title Arquitetura em Monólito Modular

!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam DefaultFontName Arial
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #444444
}

left to right direction

actor "Usuário Final" as User
actor "Terceiro" as Professional
actor "Administrador" as Admin

rectangle "Frontend Web" as Frontend
rectangle "API Gateway / BFF" as BFF

package "Diagrama Arquitetural" as Backend {

  component "Auth Module" as Auth
  component "Journal Module" as Journal
  component "AI Processing Module" as AI
  component "Catalog / Knowledge Module" as Catalog
  component "Recommendation Module" as Recommendation
  component "Sharing / Professional Module" as Sharing
  component "Data Export Module" as DataExport
  component "Notification Module" as Notification

  component "Internal Event Dispatcher\nOutbox + Workers" as Events
}

database "PostgreSQL\nSchemas por módulo" as Postgres
database "Neo4j\nTemas • Passagens • Obras • Autores" as Neo4j
cloud "S3\nPDFs • Capas • Avatares" as S3
database "Processed Events\nIdempotência interna" as ProcessedEvents

cloud "Provedor de IA\nLLM / Vetores semânticos" as LLM
cloud "Amazon SES\nE-mail" as SES

User --> Frontend
Professional --> Frontend
Admin --> Frontend

Frontend --> BFF
BFF --> Backend

Auth --> Postgres
Journal --> Postgres
Recommendation --> Postgres
Sharing --> Postgres
Events --> Postgres

Catalog --> Neo4j

Auth --> S3 : avatar do usuário
Catalog --> S3 : PDFs e capas de obras
AI --> S3 : lê PDFs de obras\npara processamento

DataExport --> Auth : perfil e avatar
DataExport --> Journal : reflexões e análises
DataExport --> Sharing : compartilhamentos e orientações

AI --> LLM
Notification --> SES

Auth --> Events
Journal --> Events
Catalog --> Events
Sharing --> Events
Recommendation --> Events

Events --> AI
Events --> Journal
Events --> Catalog
Events --> Recommendation
Events --> Notification
Events --> ProcessedEvents

note bottom of Backend
O Reflecta é implantado como um monólito modular:
uma única aplicação backend, organizada em módulos internos
com responsabilidades separadas.
end note

note right of Events
O processamento assíncrono é feito por eventos internos,
usando Outbox, workers e controle de idempotência.
end note

note bottom of Neo4j
O Neo4j armazena o conhecimento curado do sistema.
As entradas privadas do journaling permanecem no PostgreSQL.
end note

@enduml
